@startuml 05-solution-contract-wrapper
!theme plain
title Proposed Solution B: Contract-Aware Order Creation Wrapper (Pragmatic)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

participant "StripeOrderCreationHandler" as Handler
participant "ContractOrderCreationService\n(NEW)" as Service #C8E6C9
participant "SessionStateManager\n(NEW)" as SSM #C8E6C9
participant "OxidShopOrderService" as SOS
participant "Stripe\\Model\\Order" as Order
participant "Order::finalizeOrder()" as FO
participant "Contract" as Contract
database "Database" as DB

== Current Problem ==

note over Handler, FO
    **Current Flow:**
    Handler -> OxidShopOrderService -> finalizeOrder()

    **Issues:**
    1. Session state must be manually managed
    2. No central coordination
    3. Hard to test
    4. Scattered error handling
end note

== Proposed Solution: Wrapper Service ==

Handler -> Service: createOrderFromContract(contract)

activate Service #C8E6C9

Service -> Service: 1. Validate contract state

Service -> SSM: 2. prepareSessionState(contract)
activate SSM #C8E6C9

SSM -> SSM: Restore sess_challenge
SSM -> SSM: Restore sDelAddrMD5
SSM -> SSM: Restore deladrid
SSM -> SSM: Verify basket exists

SSM --> Service: SessionStateDTO
deactivate SSM

Service -> Service: 3. Validate session state

alt Session state invalid
    Service --> Handler: OrderCreationResult(error)
else Session state valid
    Service -> SOS: 4. createOrder(request)

    SOS -> Order: new Order()
    SOS -> FO: finalizeOrder()

    note right of FO
        **Inside finalizeOrder:**
        - Validation passes (state restored)
        - executePayment() returns true
        - Order created successfully
    end note

    FO --> SOS: ORDER_STATE_OK
    SOS --> Service: OrderResponse

    Service -> Service: 5. Post-processing

    Service -> Contract: linkToOrder(orderId)
    Service -> DB: Update OXPAID

    Service -> SSM: 6. cleanupSessionState()
    SSM -> SSM: Clear stripe_* variables

    Service --> Handler: OrderCreationResult(success, orderId)
end

deactivate Service

== Service Interface ==

note over Service
    **ContractOrderCreationService Interface:**

    ```php
    interface ContractOrderCreationServiceInterface
    {
        public function createOrderFromContract(
            PaymentContractInterface $contract
        ): OrderCreationResult;

        public function canCreateOrder(
            PaymentContractInterface $contract
        ): ValidationResult;
    }
    ```

    **Benefits:**
    - Single point of order creation for contracts
    - Encapsulates session state management
    - Testable (mock SessionStateManager)
    - Clear error handling
end note

== Session State Manager ==

note over SSM
    **SessionStateManager Interface:**

    ```php
    interface SessionStateManagerInterface
    {
        public function prepareForOrderCreation(
            PaymentContractInterface $contract
        ): SessionStateDTO;

        public function restoreDeliveryAddressHash(
            string $hash
        ): void;

        public function cleanup(): void;
    }
    ```

    **Responsibilities:**
    - Restore session variables from contract metadata
    - Validate session state completeness
    - Clean up after order creation
end note

@enduml
